    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dolven</strong> is a bold fusion of tactical RPG combat and card-combo strategy set in a  fantasy world teetering on the brink of darkness. Command a band of  mercenaries, harness the power of ancient runes, and battle your enemies on a dynamic, grid-based battlefield where every move\u2014and every card\u2014counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of Dolven lies a unique combat system that blends classic deck-building with the thrill of poker-style hand formation making it a first of its kind the genre of deckbuilders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/7d750e9db7c284f1543f558fedb57e52.poster.avif?t=1754264269\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/7d750e9db7c284f1543f558fedb57e52.webm?t=1754264269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/7d750e9db7c284f1543f558fedb57e52.mp4?t=1754264269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card battles include hand-to-hand combat and the cards provide characters with additional skills. What sets Dolven apart is its innovative and strategic card play mechanics, which add a touch of nostalgia by incorporating elements of classic poker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/c7f13f06124a5123e8545aa9cb180bfa.avif?t=1754264269\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players form hand combos, such as pairs, doubles, straight flushes, and flushes, to earn mana bonus's and also add to the players overall point score on the leader board.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character in Dolven belongs to one of six distinct classes: Archer, Cleric, Guardian, Mage, Rogue, or Warrior. These classes are divided into three archetypes, Strength, Intelligence, and Dexterity each offering a unique set of skills and abilities to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/ed391e5aaa5bb7710013dd82e82aaaeb.avif?t=1754264269\" /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/b367267680981f1287cef75c08c37702.avif?t=1754264269\" /></span><br><strong>Collect, create, and customize your deck.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players construct a deck made up of two main card types:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mercenary Cards</strong> \u2013 Represent characters you can summon to the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spell Cards</strong> \u2013 Cast magical effects, buffs, debuffs, or battlefield alterations. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each of the three cards are suited by color Red, Green and Blue. These colors represent their Archetype Strength, Dexterity and Intelligence.\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange the Mercenary cards on the pillars to form hands like pairs, flushes, or straight flushes. The ingame Compendium lists all possible combo's and their rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you battle through the maze of dungeons, customize your deck to maximize your combat potential. Collecting gear and armouring up your characters is also important for when you face tougher enemies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/ee540b382a088ac5093198ac62af2ee7.poster.avif?t=1754264269\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/ee540b382a088ac5093198ac62af2ee7.webm?t=1754264269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/ee540b382a088ac5093198ac62af2ee7.mp4?t=1754264269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure into the dungeons of the Decaying Isle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something ancient sleeps beneath Dolven\u2026 and it is waking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the cursed town of Dolven, shadows grow longer and whispers of the dead stir the wind. As a seasoned mercenary drawn into a missing child\u2019s case, you soon uncover a trail that leads far deeper than expected\u2014into a web of forgotten oaths, ancestral bloodlines, and a darkness older than memory.\u00a0Can a father rewrite fate, or is he merely a piece in a god\u2019s cruel design?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/2fff161f77a86acf965d1b1d204e7f06.poster.avif?t=1754264269\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/2fff161f77a86acf965d1b1d204e7f06.webm?t=1754264269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/2fff161f77a86acf965d1b1d204e7f06.mp4?t=1754264269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Narrative-Driven RPG with Six Endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you <strong>honor your oath</strong>, or <strong>break it</strong> for a greater good?<br>Can a corrupted soul still choose <strong>redemption</strong>, or are some fates sealed in blood?<br>What if the prophecy you follow\u2026 was <strong>never meant to be fulfilled</strong>?<br>Would you trade a loved one to <strong>save the world</strong>\u2014or let the world burn to protect them?<br>Who decides what is light and what is darkness\u2026 when both wear the face of royalty?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With six distinct endings and a final, hidden reckoning only the brave will discover, <i>Dolven</i> is a story of loyalty, loss, and the unseen cost of doing what\u2019s right. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/01a748af6edc606065d2cf6bdedcf578.poster.avif?t=1754264269\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/01a748af6edc606065d2cf6bdedcf578.webm?t=1754264269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/01a748af6edc606065d2cf6bdedcf578.mp4?t=1754264269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/539fe59d119262e223b3971287abc131.poster.avif?t=1754264269\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/539fe59d119262e223b3971287abc131.webm?t=1754264269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/539fe59d119262e223b3971287abc131.mp4?t=1754264269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
