lass=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/ee540b382a088ac5093198ac62af2ee7.poster.avif?t=1754264269\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/ee540b382a088ac5093198ac62af2ee7.webm?t=1754264269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/ee540b382a088ac5093198ac62af2ee7.mp4?t=1754264269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure into the dungeons of the Decaying Isle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something ancient sleeps beneath Dolven\u2026 and it is waking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the cursed town of Dolven, shadows grow longer and whispers of the dead stir the wind. As a seasoned mercenary drawn into a missing child\u2019s case, you soon uncover a trail that leads far deeper than expected\u2014into a web of forgotten oaths, ancestral bloodlines, and a darkness older than memory.\u00a0Can a father rewrite fate, or is he merely a piece in a god\u2019s cruel design?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/2fff161f77a86acf965d1b1d204e7f06.poster.avif?t=1754264269\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/2fff161f77a86acf965d1b1d204e7f06.webm?t=1754264269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/2fff161f77a86acf965d1b1d204e7f06.mp4?t=1754264269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Narrative-Driven RPG with Six Endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you <strong>honor your oath</strong>, or <strong>break it</strong> for a greater good?<br>Can a corrupted soul still choose <strong>redemption</strong>, or are some fates sealed in blood?<br>What if the prophecy you follow\u2026 was <strong>never meant to be fulfilled</strong>?<br>Would you trade a loved one to <strong>save the world</strong>\u2014or let the world burn to protect them?<br>Who decides what is light and what is darkness\u2026 when both wear the face of royalty?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With six distinct endings and a final, hidden reckoning only the brave will discover, <i>Dolven</i> is a story of loyalty, loss, and the unseen cost of doing what\u2019s right. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/01a748af6edc606065d2cf6bdedcf578.poster.avif?t=1754264269\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/01a748af6edc606065d2cf6bdedcf578.webm?t=1754264269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/01a748af6edc606065d2cf6bdedcf578.mp4?t=1754264269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/539fe59d119262e223b3971287abc131.poster.avif?t=1754264269\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369850/extras/539fe59d119262e223b3971287abc131.webm?t=1754264269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps